"source_term":"以母老須養","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"close_family_mother_old_care_resumed_subject","roles":{"head":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0122","mother":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0060","patron":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0027","prince":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0054","official":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0080","patron_resumed":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0134"},"clause_start":0,"clause_end":146,"paragraph_sha256":"1ad0ba572cf4af1c2775f9ce7f55d569a1579617ccb9ae043b77d9072b08b89e","revision_id":2400356},"role":"mother_unspecified","biological_mother":null,"father_person_id":null},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","source_id":"s-nanqishu043-ws2400356","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003","quote":"解褐車騎行參軍，遷祕書郎，司徒祭酒，丹陽丞，撫軍功曹。世祖爲中軍，引爲記室。齊臺建，遷太子中舍人。建元初，轉桂陽王友。以母老須養，出爲安成內史。還爲中書郎。衞軍王儉引爲長史，雅相禮遇。除黃門郎，兼掌吏部。尋轉太子中庶子，領驍騎將軍，轉長兼侍中。𤅢以晨昏有廢，固辭不受。世祖勑令速拜，別停朝直。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0122","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0060"}],"interpretation_note":"官歷以𤅢晨昏有廢續寫母老須養；保存特定母角色，未明生母或父母婚配。"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"id":"le-nanqi043-xieyue-mother","person_id":"pm0_bw3_z6p","event_type":"death","date_expression":null,"source_term":"母喪","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","source_id":"s-nanqishu043-ws2400356","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p004","quote":"遷司徒左長史，出爲吳興太守。長城縣民盧道優家遭劫，誣同縣殷孝悌等四人爲劫，𤅢收付縣獄考正。孝悌母駱詣登聞訴稱孝悌爲道優所誹謗，橫劾爲劫，一百七十三人連名保徵，在所不爲申理。𤅢聞孝悌母訴，乃啓建康獄覆，道優理窮款首，依法斬刑。有司奏免𤅢官。又使典藥吏煮湯，失火，燒郡外齋南廂屋五閒。又輙鞭除身，爲有司所奏，詔竝贖論。在郡稱爲美績。母喪去官。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p004:m0164"}],"interpretation_note":"段末母喪去官承𤅢，不指中段孝悌母駱；未載卒年。"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"pm0_bw3_z6p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"p003以母老須養與晨昏有廢承傳主𤅢，p004段末母喪去官同為𤅢之母；中段孝悌母駱別指。特定母角色，原文未明生母，不推配莊。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-mother","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p004:m0164","start":164,"end":165,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"pm0_bw3_z6p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"p003以母老須養與晨昏有廢承傳主𤅢，p004段末母喪去官同為𤅢之母；中段孝悌母駱別指。特定母角色，原文未明生母，不推配莊。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-mother","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p004","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue"}],"relations":[{"status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"id":"a-nanqi043-xieyue-mother","subject_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAC","predicate":"maternal_role","object_person_id":"pm0_bw3_z6p","qualifiers":{"source_term":"以母老須養","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"close_family_mother_old_care_resumed_subject","roles":{"head":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0122","mother":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0060","patron":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0027","prince":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0054","official":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0080","patron_resumed":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0134"},"clause_start":0,"clause_end":146,"paragraph_sha256":"1ad0ba572cf4af1c2775f9ce7f55d569a1579617ccb9ae043b77d9072b08b89e","revision_id":2400356},"role":"mother_unspecified","biological_mother":null,"father_person_id":null},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","source_id":"s-nanqishu043-ws2400356","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003","quote":"解褐車騎行參軍，遷祕書郎，司徒祭酒，丹陽丞，撫軍功曹。世祖爲中軍，引爲記室。齊臺建，遷太子中舍人。建元初，轉桂陽王友。以母老須養，出爲安成內史。還爲中書郎。衞軍王儉引爲長史，雅相禮遇。除黃門郎，兼掌吏部。尋轉太子中庶子，領驍騎將軍，轉長兼侍中。𤅢以晨昏有廢，固辭不